<div class="info-page" style="max-width: 800px; margin: var(--space-8) auto; padding: 0 var(--space-4);">
  <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6); border: var(--border-thick); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface-card);">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Community Rules</h1>

    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-md); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
      The Vinyl Drop is a local community space for record lovers, collectors, DJs, and diggers to trade physical vinyl. Like any good local record shop, we thrive on mutual trust, passion for music, and respect for everyone who walks through the door.
    </p>

    <div style="padding: var(--space-4); background: var(--color-paper-muted); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-rust); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); margin: 0; color: var(--color-ink);">
        <strong>House Tone:</strong> We love the raw culture, attitude, and freedom of music — sex, drugs &amp; rock 'n' roll are part of the heritage of the records we spin, but disrespecting fellow human beings is strictly forbidden in our shop.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Unacceptable Conduct</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: var(--color-ink-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
      We strictly prohibit the following behaviors across all public profiles, comments, listings, and interactions:
    </p>

    <ul style="line-height: 1.8; margin-left: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
      <li><strong>Racism and Hate Speech:</strong> Any discrimination, bigotry, slurs, or hatred targeting race, ethnicity, nationality, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or age.</li>
      <li><strong>Harassment:</strong> Intimidation, persistent unwanted attention, or bullying towards any community member.</li>
      <li><strong>Threats:</strong> Any violent threats, direct or implied, toward individuals or groups.</li>
      <li><strong>Doxxing:</strong> Publishing or threatening to reveal private personal information of any individual (real name, phone number, address, workplace) without explicit consent.</li>
      <li><strong>Deliberate Abuse, Scams or Misuse:</strong> Fraudulent listings, counterfeit records sold as originals, intentional grading misrepresentation, spamming, or malicious exploitation of the platform.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Content Rights &amp; Authenticity</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-sm); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
      Upload only photos and submit only text or other material that you created or are authorised to use. Do not copy another person's private information or use artwork, photographs, logos or descriptions in a way that infringes someone else's rights. Describe records honestly. A counterfeit record must never be presented as an original pressing.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Reporting Content</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-sm); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
      Use the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> to report a specific listing, profile or comment. Choose the closest report category, provide the exact page URL and explain the facts and why you believe the content is illegal or violates these Rules. For an illegal-content, copyright/trademark or counterfeit/fraud notice, provide your name and reply email and confirm that you believe the information and allegations are accurate and complete and that you are reporting in good faith. Do not attach or send copies of illegal material.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-sm); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
      Reports are reviewed manually by the operator. The operator may take no action, ask for clarification, hide or remove content, or restrict an account where reasonably necessary. Decisions should be assessed individually and proportionately. A person affected by a moderation action may contact the operator to ask for a human reconsideration. There is no automated moderation or guaranteed response time.
    </p>

    <div class="info-page-actions" style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: var(--border-thick); display: flex; gap: var(--space-4);">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Contact Support / Report Issue</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
